11
00:59:53,333 --> 00:59:59,333
Larry Crowne is a 2011 American romantic comedy film
starring Tom Hanks and Julia Roberts.

12
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:26,000
The film was produced and directed by Hanks, who
co-wrote its screenplay with Nia Vardalos.

13
01:10:46,666 --> 01:10:52,666
The story was inspired by Hanks' time studying at Chabot College.

14
01:16:13,333 --> 01:16:19,333
The film tells the story of Larry Crowne, a middle-aged man who
unexpectedly loses his job and returns to education.

15
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:46,000
It was released in the United States on July 1, 2011.

16
01:27:06,666 --> 01:27:12,666
The film explores themes of classroom, college, diner, teacher, love.

17
01:32:33,333 --> 01:32:39,333
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
